{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51102","headline":"归燕吟献太尉 · 崔致远","name":"归燕吟献太尉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋去春来能守信，暖风凉雨饱相谙。\n再依大厦虽知许，久污雕梁却自慙。\n深避鹰鸇投海岛，羡他鸳鹭戏江潭。\n只将名品齐黄雀，独让衔环意未甘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}